<title>UK: Goldman Sachs sets calls on Hoogovens certificates.</title>
<headline>Goldman Sachs sets calls on Hoogovens certificates.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs &amp; Co. said it has issued five million American-style call warrants, on Koninklijke Nederlandsche Hoogovens en Staalfabrieken NV certificates.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 10 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    150 NLG		   PREMIUM	32.28 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     1.95 DEM		  GEARING	5.92 X</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 05.AUG.97-19.MAR.99   PAYDATE	04.AUG.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   DUSS, FFURT	     MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  130 NLG    NLG/DEM 1.1265</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
